<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rusplats half yr shr, div, output down.</title>
<headline>Rusplats half yr shr, div, output down.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to December 31 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, distrib (cts)	 81.6  vs    125.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		    50.0  vs     75.0</p>
<p>    Distrib income	    736.7  vs    678.4</p>
